<p>The LVL format is used by the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Level%20editor" title="Level editor">level editor</a>. It is a rebranded <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/ERF" title="ERF">ERF</a> file; if you rename it with an .erf extension you can open it with the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/ERF%20editor" title="ERF editor (page does not exist)">ERF editor</a> and extract resources from it.
</p><p>For a list of LVL files used in the Single Player Campaign, see <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Area%20layouts%20used%20in%20the%20single%20player%20module" title="Area layouts used in the single player module">Area layouts used in the single player module</a>.
</p>
